`taking cash to fix a matter` MEANS `My dealing` WITH
    `my side` IS `I solicited, received or agreed to receive it`
    `what was involved` IS `money`
    `the person on the receiving side is an agent` IS FALSE
    `it was for someone doing or not doing something in a matter` IS TRUE
    `it was for an act or favour in relation to the agent's principal's affairs` IS FALSE
    `I had reason to believe or suspect it concerned the principal's affairs` IS FALSE
    `the court finds I acted corruptly` IS TRUE
    `the receiver was employed by the Government, a department or a public body` IS FALSE
    `the giver, or the one they acted for, has or seeks dealings with the Government, a department or a public body` IS FALSE
    `it was actually paid, given or received` IS FALSE
    `the court is satisfied I proved the contrary` IS FALSE
    `the agent had no power or opportunity to do it` IS FALSE
    `the act was never done` IS FALSE

