§ `ss 5 to 7, 10 to 12, 18(2), 21(2), 29 to 32 -- punishment`

`a section 5(b) bribe` MEANS `My sentencing facts` WITH
    `the offence I am convicted of` IS `section 5(b) corruptly giving, promising or offering`
    `my part` IS `I committed it myself`
    `the matter was a government or public-body contract, a proposal for one, or a subcontract under one` IS FALSE

`a section 5(b) bribe over a government contract` MEANS `My sentencing facts` WITH
    `the offence I am convicted of` IS `section 5(b) corruptly giving, promising or offering`
    `my part` IS `I committed it myself`
    `the matter was a government or public-body contract, a proposal for one, or a subcontract under one` IS TRUE

`a section 6(c) false invoice on a public-body subcontract` MEANS `My sentencing facts` WITH
    `the offence I am convicted of` IS `section 6(c) a false document given to or used by an agent`
    `my part` IS `I committed it myself`
    `the matter was a government or public-body contract, a proposal for one, or a subcontract under one` IS TRUE

`abetting a section 6(a) kickback` MEANS `My sentencing facts` WITH
    `the offence I am convicted of` IS `section 6(a) an agent corruptly accepting or obtaining`
    `my part` IS `I abetted it`
    `the matter was a government or public-body contract, a proposal for one, or a subcontract under one` IS FALSE

`attempting to bribe a Member of Parliament` MEANS `My sentencing facts` WITH
    `the offence I am convicted of` IS `section 11(a) offering to a Member of Parliament`
    `my part` IS `I attempted it`
    `the matter was a government or public-body contract, a proposal for one, or a subcontract under one` IS FALSE

`conspiring to buy off a tenderer` MEANS `My sentencing facts` WITH
    `the offence I am convicted of` IS `section 10(a) offering for the withdrawal of a tender`
    `my part` IS `I was party to a criminal conspiracy to commit it`
    `the matter was a government or public-body contract, a proposal for one, or a subcontract under one` IS FALSE

`failing to produce bank records` MEANS `My sentencing facts` WITH
    `the offence I am convicted of` IS `section 18(2) failing to disclose or produce under an investigation order`
    `my part` IS `I committed it myself`
    `the matter was a government or public-body contract, a proposal for one, or a subcontract under one` IS FALSE

`ignoring the Public Prosecutor's notice` MEANS `My sentencing facts` WITH
    `the offence I am convicted of` IS `section 21(2) failing to comply with the Public Prosecutor's notice`
    `my part` IS `I committed it myself`
    `the matter was a government or public-body contract, a proposal for one, or a subcontract under one` IS FALSE

`a public officer letting a briber go` MEANS `My sentencing facts` WITH
    `the offence I am convicted of` IS `section 32(2) a public officer failing to arrest a briber`
    `my part` IS `I committed it myself`
    `the matter was a government or public-body contract, a proposal for one, or a subcontract under one` IS TRUE

